Roboto-msdf.json / Roboto-msdf.png

A multi-channel signed distance field (MSDF) atlas of the Roboto typeface,
as hosted by the A-Frame project at https://cdn.aframe.io/fonts/ and used as
the default font of A-Frame's `text` component.

- The Roboto typeface is (c) Google and is licensed under the Apache License,
  Version 2.0: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
- A-Frame (which publishes the atlas) is licensed under the MIT License; see
  aframe-1.7.1.LICENSE in this folder.
